fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"tensordecoders/ioutracker.html#ioutracker:min-frame-count-for-lost-track","fragment":"\n\tmin-frame-count-for-lost-track\n\nMin number of frame where object is not seen, required to mark object as lost.\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\t5\n\n"});